    "description": "20 MHz AT-cut quartz crystal unit, fundamental mode, in a 4-pad ceramic SMD package (3.2 x 2.5 x 0.8 mm, CX3225GB series). Two-terminal passive resonator (pins 1 and 3 are the crystal terminals; pins 2 and 4 are no-connect). Parallel-resonant, specified at CL = 7 pF. Pb-free, RoHS compliant, MSL 1.",
    "package": "SMD ceramic, 3.2x2.5x0.8mm (4-pad)",
    "pinCount": 4,
    "lifecycle": "active",
    "temperatureGrade": "-40..85",
    "msl": "MSL1",
